1
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:12,200
A cold December evening in Mexico City.

2
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,600
On a pole, SMAA wakes up…

3
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:20,600
…and starts to breathe.

4
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:26,400
A laser counts every particle that crosses its beam.

5
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:31,600
Gases react on electrodes and become current.

6
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:36,400
Every pulse becomes a measurement…

7
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:41,400
…and every measurement, open data.

8
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:49,200
That's how it reaches AIreGPT, so you know what to do.
